{"id": "mtc-subrecipient-audit-decision-delays", "title": "MTC sent two of five sampled grant audit decisions after the six-month deadline", "seconds": 41.0, "voice": "tinyvoca:F2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "3e8915697a5b5324", "words": 115, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A regional transportation agency had 6 months to act on certain grant audit findings.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.99, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "did", "the", "letters", "go", "out?"], "sub": "The federal review deadline"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "That clock started when the federal clearinghouse accepted a recipient’s audit.", "t0": 5.11, "t1": 9.02, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "finding", "kicker": "The federal review deadline", "text": "Federal acceptance date", "mark": "Federal"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors tested five recipients and found that 2 of 5 letters were late.", "t0": 9.24, "t1": 13.18, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "finding", "layout": "table", "heading": "Five subrecipients sampled", "context": "Metropolitan Transportation Commission", "rows": [{"label": "Letters after deadline", "value": "2 of 5"}, {"label": "Deadline", "value": "6 months"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditors reported no questioned costs.", "t0": 13.3, "t1": 15.67, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "finding", "kicker": "Two letters outside six months", "text": "No questioned costs", "mark": "No"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Commission said the internal reviews were on time.", "t0": 15.79, "t1": 18.56, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "Review completed before the letters", "text": "Review completed", "mark": "Review"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The formal letters went out later.", "t0": 18.68, "t1": 20.37, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "Review completed before the letters", "text": "Formal letters", "mark": "Formal"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "It also said the recipients’ findings concerned funds from elsewhere.", "t0": 20.49, "t1": 23.98, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "Review completed before the letters", "text": "Commission response", "mark": "Commission"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditors recommended reviewing files every four to five months.", "t0": 24.1, "t1": 27.74, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "Review completed before the letters", "text": "More frequent review", "mark": "More"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2021 auditors again tested the highway program.", "t0": 27.96, "t1": 31.31, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "newreport", "layout": "table", "heading": "Major program coverage", "context": "Metropolitan Transportation Commission", "rows": [{"label": "FY2020", "value": "Transit and planning"}, {"label": "FY2021", "value": "Highway and transit"}]}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "They reported no findings in that audit.", "t0": 31.43, "t1": 33.52, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "nextreport", "kicker": "Subsequent audit coverage", "text": "Later audit results", "mark": "Later"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The original acceptance and letter dates would establish the actual delays.", "t0": 33.64, "t1": 37.49, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "nextreport", "kicker": "Subsequent audit coverage", "text": "Original letter dates", "mark": "Original"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 37.61, "t1": 40.09, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The federal review deadline", "b": "Two letters outside six months", "o": "Subsequent audit coverage"}, "look": "kinetic", "hook": "contrast"}